          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akawaambia, Hakika mtakinywea kikombe changu; lakini kuketi mkono wangu wa kuume na mkono wangu wa kushoto, sina amri kuwapa, bali watapewa waliowekewa tayari na Baba yangu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
